$ sisu eval settings.sisu
{
  "SAUNA": "Kota",
  "STOVE": {
    "kilowatts": 9,
    "wood": true
  }
}
$ sisu eval settings.sisu --to yaml
SAUNA: "Kota"
STOVE:
  kilowatts: 9
  wood: true
$ sisu eval
usage: sisu eval <file>

the constants of a configuration module, as JSON (`--to toml` or `--to yaml` for TOML or YAML), from stage 1's compile-time evaluator
